<title>UK: CADES sets 12.0 bln French franc July 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>CADES sets 12.0 bln French franc July 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French welfare debt repayment fund CADES has launched a 12.0 billion French franc bond maturing on 25 July 2005, joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole said.</p>
<p>The 6.0 percent deal was reoffered at 99.749 to yield seven basis points over OATs.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
